{"id":"d53095b8-b528-47ed-8ccf-d0497cec2def","revision":0,"last_node_id":33,"last_link_id":19,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-40,20],"size":[560,760],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## Fish Audio Drama 3 · two-voice dialogue with voice cloning\n\n**Nodes:** [ComfyUI-Drama3](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-Drama3) (ComfyUI v0.40+). `git clone` it into `custom_nodes`, restart.\n\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| drama3_fp8experts_bf16.safetensors (38.6 GB, original weights, ~48 GB RAM)<br>or drama3_w6a8experts_bf16 (32.7 GB, ~40 GB RAM)<br>or drama3_w4a8experts_bf16 (24.6 GB, ~32 GB RAM) | models/diffusion_models |\n| drama3_codec.safetensors | models/vae |\n| qwen3_asr_1.7b_bf16.safetensors or qwen3_asr_0.6b_bf16 | models/asr |\n\nFrom [PedroMarinhoDev/Drama-3-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Drama-3-ComfyUI) and [PedroMarinhoDev/Qwen3-ASR-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Qwen3-ASR-ComfyUI).\n\n**Use:** load a few seconds of clean speech for each voice (cut between sentences). Qwen3-ASR writes each transcript; to type one yourself, delete its link into Encode Voice. Voice A is in slot voice0 → `<|speaker:0|>`, Voice B in voice1 → `<|speaker:1|>`. Start each line of the script with its speaker tag; cues like [sighs], [laughs], [whispers] go where the sound should land.\n\n**Single voice:** delete the Voice B group and drop the speaker tags.\n\n**Keep a voice:** un-mute a Save Drama 3 Voice node (select, Ctrl+M), queue once; later swap Load Audio + ASR + Encode for Load Drama 3 Voice.\n\n**Settings:** temperature 1.0, top_p 0.9, top_k 0 (the Drama 3 Space defaults). Experts in RAM + expert_cache_gb 0 (= use free VRAM) runs on 8 GB+ cards. If a take goes silent early, re-queue for a new seed or try a different reference clip.\n\nWeights: Fish Audio Community License. Only clone voices you have consent to use."],"widgets_value